	"gm_notes": "The three play surfaces from Wiki/Missions/Ember-Extraction.md, in beat order: rendezvous on the frozen Songhua (contact + verification, ~10 ft/hex), the compound workstation in its guarded and after-hours layers (heist + puzzle — stage 'epoch_site' if the party goes in loud, 'epoch_site_dark' if they wait for the shift change), and the rail yard for the chase out. Deep winter throughout, but the weather is NOT uniform: snow falls on the two outdoor tiles (rendezvous, extraction) and is off inside the compound, and the yard swaps the winter-wind bed for rail-yard ambience. So the tile-to-tile contrast the projector gives you is weather first, then light — bonfire and braziers, then near-blackout, then the yard's lamps. Music is placeholder (test_mission) pending Alexandre's Suno suite.",
